  "todayTitle": "He aha te mea tino uaua i tēnei rā?",
  "todayIntro": "Kōwhiria kotahi. Ka whai koe i ngā mea e toru hei whakamātau, i te wā hei tiki āwhina, me tētahi mahi ngāwari. Ā muri ake, pāwhiria te āhua o te haere.",
  "todayTryHeading": "Whakamātauria tētahi o ēnei",
  "todayGetHelp": "Tiki āwhina",
  "todayHelpDoctor": "Waeahia tō rātou rata i taua rā ake mēnā ka tīmata ohorere tēnei, ka tino kino rānei i roto i ngā haora, i ngā rā rānei. Pērā anō mēnā he kirika, he mamae, he rongoā hōu rānei. I te U.S., waeahia te 911 mō ngā ohotata. Ki wāhi kē, whakamahia te tau ohotata o te rohe.",
  "todayHelpVisit": "Mēnā ka kite koe i tētahi panoni ohorere i te haerenga, whakamōhiotia ngā kaimahi, tō rātou rata rānei i taua rā ake. I te U.S., waeahia te 911 mō ngā ohotata. Ki wāhi kē, whakamahia te tau ohotata o te rohe.",
  "todayHelpCrisis": "Mēnā kei te raru nui koe, waea, tuku kuputuhi rānei ki te 988 i te U.S. me ōna rohe. Ki wāhi kē, whakapā ki tētahi raina raru o te rohe. I te ohotata, waeahia te 911 i te U.S., whakamahia rānei te tau ohotata o te rohe ki wāhi kē.",
