  "todayGoHomeTry3": "Tirohia ngā mea ngāwari: te hiakai, te hiainu, te wharepaku, te mamae, te wera rawa, te makariri rawa rānei.",
  "todaySameQuestion": "Ka pātai tonu rātou i taua pātai anō",
