  "todaySaysNoTry2": "Whakaitihia, whakangāwaritia rānei, me te tono i tō rātou āwhina: “Ka taea e koe te āwhina i a au ki te kōpaki i ēnei?”",
  "todaySaysNoTry3": "Tirohia mēnā kua ngenge, kāore e ora pai, kāore e noho humarie, e hohoro rānei, tae atu ki a koe anō.",
  "todayLateDay": "Ka pōrearea ngā ahiahi tōmuri",
