  "todayNothingToDo": "Kāore he mea e hiahia ana rātou ki te mahi",
  "todayNothingToDoTry1": "Tīmata mai i tō rātou ake oranga: tā rātou mahi, ā rātou mahi whakangahau, tō rātou whakapono, te puoro e tino pai ana rānei.",
  "todayNothingToDoTry2": "Tukua e rua ngā kōwhiringa, kaua he rārangi, ā, māu anō te wāhanga uaua e mahi.",
  "todayNothingToDoTry3": "Ka whai wāhi te tiro noa, te pupuri i tētahi mea, te noho tata rānei. He pai te whakamutu wawe.",
  "todayHardToTalk": "He uaua te kōrero ngātahi",
  "todayHardToTalkTry1": "Whakamutua te haruru o muri, ā, kia tūtaki ngā karu i mua i te tīmata.",
  "todayHardToTalkTry2": "Whakamahia ngā rerenga poto, ā, tukua e rua ngā kōwhiringa: “He tī, he kawhe rānei?”",
  "todayHardToTalkTry3": "Tatari mō te whakautu. Whakautua te kare-ā-roto kei muri i ngā kupu, ā, tuaria he pikitia.",
  "todayVisit": "Kei te haere mai he haerenga, he waea rānei",
  "todayVisitTry1": "Mihia ā-ingoa, ā, kī atu ko wai koe: “Kia ora Māmā, ko Mere tēnei, tō tamāhine.”",
  "todayVisitTry2": "Kawea tētahi, e rua rānei ngā mea hei tuari: he pukapuka whakaahua, he waiata e pai ana, he paraikete ngohengohe.",
  "todayVisitTry3": "Kia poto, kia kotahi tonu te poroporoaki i ia wā, ā, wehe me te kore e whakaroa.",
