  "languageTitle": "Reo",
  "languageIntro": "Ka tīmata te taupānga i te reo o tēnei pūrere. Kōwhiria tētahi atu reo i konei, ā, ka mau tonu taua kōwhiringa kia kōwhiri anō koe.",
