  "habitsHomeButton": "Ngā tikanga hauora",
  "habitsTitle": "Ngā tikanga e tika ana kia kōrerotia",
  "habitsIntro": "E hono ana ēnei tikanga ki te iti ake o te tūpono mate wareware puta noa i ngā rōpū tangata nunui. Ehara i te oati mō tētahi tangata kotahi. Kāore anō tētahi tikanga, kēmu, kai rānei kia whakamanahia hei ārai i te mate wareware.",
  "habitsHearingVisionTitle": "Ngā tirotiro rongo me te kite",
  "habitsHearingVisionBody": "Ko te ngaro rongo me te ngaro kitenga kāore anō kia rongoātia e hono ana ki te tūpono nui ake o te mate wareware. He tere te tirotiro, ā, ka māmā ake pea te oranga o ia rā mā te rongoā i tētahi, ahakoa te pānga ki te tūpono mate wareware.",
  "habitsHeartTitle": "Te pēhanga toto me te cholesterol",
  "habitsHeartBody": "Ko te pēhanga toto teitei me te cholesterol teitei i te pakeketanga e hono ana ki te tūpono nui ake o te mate wareware. Ka taea e tētahi rata te tirotiro i te rua, ā, te kōrero mō te mea e tika ana mōu.",
  "habitsMoveTitle": "Whakakorikoria tō tinana",
  "habitsMoveBody": "Ko te kori tinana e hono ana ki te tūpono iti ake o te mate wareware, ā, he āwhina ki te hauora i ētahi atu āhuatanga. Kōwhiria tētahi mea e pai ana ki a koe, ā, ka taea te haere tonu, ā, pātaihia tētahi rata i te tuatahi mēnā kāore koe i te tino mōhio.",
  "habitsConnectTitle": "Noho tūhono ki ngā tāngata",
  "habitsConnectBody": "Ko te noho mokemoke e hono ana ki te tūpono nui ake o te mate wareware. He mea tika kia whakaritea he wā i ngā wā katoa ki ngā hoa, ki te whānau, ki tētahi rōpū rānei.",
  "habitsSmokeTitle": "Te hikareti me te waipiro",
  "habitsSmokeBody": "Ko te momi hikareti me te inu waipiro nui e hono ana ki te tūpono nui ake o te mate wareware. Mēnā e hiahia ana koe ki te whakaiti, ki te whakamutu rānei, ka āwhina tētahi rata, ratonga rohe rānei.",
  "habitsHeadTitle": "Tiakina tō māhunga",
  "habitsHeadBody": "Ko ngā whara māhunga e hono ana ki te tūpono nui ake o te mate wareware. Ko te potae pūhoro mō te eke paihikara, me te tūpato i ngā arapiki me te waka, he mahi ngāwari.",
  "habitsDoctorNote": "Kāore tēnei katoa e whakakapi i te tohutohu a tētahi rata. Mēnā e māharahara ana koe mō tō maumahara, mō te mate wareware rānei, kōrero ki tētahi rata.",
  "habitsSourcesTitle": "Nō hea tēnei",
  "habitsSources": "Te Komihana Lancet 2024 mō te ārai, te wawaotanga me te manaaki i te mate wareware. Ko ōna tau e whakaahua ana i ngā taupori katoa, ehara i tētahi tangata kotahi. Kei dementiaactivities.games te aratohu whai pūtake (i te reo Ingarihi).",
